wb-mqtt-tlv493 (1.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Exit with 2 instead of 6 when the config path argument is missing or an unknown argument is given
  * Wait for an unavailable MQTT broker and for the I2C bus instead of exiting, exit 2 on a rejected login
  * Publish and log the sensor error only when its state changes; republish the state on every connect
  * Remove all four retained topics on SIGINT/SIGTERM, report when the broker is not connected
  * Require python3-wb-common >= 2.4.0 for the retry-forever MQTT client

